        <div class="value-grid">
            <div class="row g-0">
                <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
                    <div class="value-box">
                        <strong>Free</strong>
                        <span>No cost to try</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
                    <div class="value-box">
                        <strong>2 tools</strong>
                        <span>Nutrition + Wellness</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
                    <div class="value-box">
                        <strong>Real plan</strong>
                        <span>Not generic advice</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
                    <div class="value-box">
                        <strong>Better routine</strong>
                        <span>Meals + movement + sleep</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <h2 class="g-title">
            Why this is such a strong <span class="highlight">free offer</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="g-subtitle">
            Most people do not need more random health content. They need clarity. These calculators give them a fast, useful, personalized starting point â€”
            and that makes registering feel like a smart move, not a commitment trap.
        </p>

