            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-brain big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Less guesswork</h3>
                    <p>Users stop bouncing between TikTok advice, YouTube opinions, and random calorie calculators that do not understand their real life.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Immediate value</h3>
                    <p>Before they even place an order, they already receive something practical: a better understanding of what to eat, how to train, and how to recover.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-repeat big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Natural path to meals</h3>
                    <p>Once users see their nutrition and routine more clearly, your meal plans become the next obvious step instead of a hard sell.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="row g-4 align-items-stretch">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="tool-showcase">
                    <span class="badge-pill badge-soft mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Free Nutrition Advisor
                    </span>

                    <h3>Know what your body may need</h3>
                    <p>
                        This tool helps users estimate daily calories, protein, hydration, fiber and food targets in a way that feels practical and real.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="tool-list">
                        <li>Personalized calorie target based on goal and activity</li>
                        <li>Protein goal with real portions like eggs, chicken, tuna and protein scoops</li>
                        <li>Hydration and fiber guidance that feels usable</li>
                        <li>Simple copyable daily plan users can actually follow</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="{{ path('signup?level=5') }}" class="btn-main">
