                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="tool-showcase">
                    <span class="badge-pill badge-soft mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dumbbell"></i> Free Wellness Advisor
                    </span>

                    <h3>Get a real weekly routine</h3>
                    <p>
                        This tool acts more like a coach. It gives users a structured weekly plan with exact training days, exercise ideas, cardio guidance, bedtime targets and recovery direction.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="tool-list">
                        <li>Coach-style weekly schedule from Monday to Sunday</li>
                        <li>Gym, home and no-gym options</li>
                        <li>Training time guidance based on real availability</li>
                        <li>Suggested bedtime, wake-up time and reset habits</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="{{ path('signup?level=5') }}" class="btn-main">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Try it free
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark-band">
    <div class="container-narrow">
        <h2 class="g-title text-center">
            Built for <span class="highlight">real people</span>, not just fitness influencers
        </h2>
        <p class="g-subtitle text-center">
            These tools are designed to feel useful for the person who is busy, overwhelmed, trying to restart, trying to stay consistent, or simply wants a more practical routine.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="dark-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i>
                    <h4>Busy professionals</h4>
                    <p>People who want a better routine without turning wellness into another full-time job.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="dark-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-child-reaching"></i>
                    <h4>Parents & families</h4>
                    <p>Users who need a plan that respects limited time, real stress, and changing schedules.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="dark-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking"></i>
                    <h4>Beginners</h4>
                    <p>Perfect for people who are starting with walking, home workouts, or simple better habits.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="dark-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-dumbbell"></i>
                    <h4>Goal-driven users</h4>
                    <p>Also useful for people who want more structure around protein, workouts, recovery and progress.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <h2 class="g-title">
            How it works in <span class="highlight">3 quick steps</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="g-subtitle">
            This is one of the easiest ways to turn cold traffic into leads: offer real value first, then invite the next step.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">01</div>
                    <h4>Create your free account</h4>
                    <p>Users register once and immediately unlock the free tools instead of landing on a dead-end sales page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">02</div>
                    <h4>Use both calculators</h4>
                    <p>They get nutrition targets, training structure, sleep guidance and a better sense of what their routine needs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">03</div>
                    <h4>Move into meal plans</h4>
                    <p>Once they see what supports their goals, your meals become the natural next action â€” not a random product push.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt text-center">
    <div class="container-narrow">
        <h2 class="g-title">
            Free tools can make your meal plans <span class="highlight">convert better</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="g-subtitle">
            When users understand their goals more clearly, they become more confident buyers. They stop asking, â€œShould I do this?â€
            and start thinking, â€œWhat should I order first?â€
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Better-qualified leads</h3>
                    <p>People who register for useful tools are often warmer and more intentional than random clicks.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Higher trust</h3>
                    <p>Free value builds credibility fast. It shows your brand is not just trying to sell meals â€” it is trying to help.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card-clean">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping big-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Cleaner conversion path</h3>
                    <p>Once the tools define the need, the meal plan becomes the obvious solution to support that routine.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section text-center">
    <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="final-cta">
            <h2 class="g-title" style="color:#fff;">
                Start with the free tools. Stay for the better routine.
            </h2>
            <p>
                Give yourself a smarter place to begin. Unlock your <strong>free Nutrition Advisor</strong> and <strong>free Wellness Advisor</strong>,
                then explore meal plans that support your goals with less chaos and more consistency.
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-content-center">
                <a href="{{ path('signup?level=5') }}" class="btn-main">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Create free account
                </a>
                <a href="{{ path('/meal-plans') }}" class="btn-glass">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bowl-food"></i> View meal plans
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</main>
{% endblock %}
